  <h1>Community resource directory</h1>
  <p>Find local advice, practical support, and opportunities to build everyday skills.</p>

  <section aria-labelledby="getting-started-heading">
    <h2 id="getting-started-heading">Find support in your area</h2>
    <p>Start with the <a href="#community-services">community services directory</a> or read <a href="#choosing-support">how to choose the right support</a>.</p>
    <p>If you need help deciding where to begin, <a href="#contact-team">Click here</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="community-services" aria-labelledby="community-services-heading">
    <h2 id="community-services-heading">Community services</h2>
    <div class="resource-grid">
      <article class="resource-card" id="food-support">
        <h4 data-resource-title="food">Food support</h4>
        <p>Find community meals, low-cost groceries, and emergency food support.</p>
        <a href="#food-support-information" data-card-link="food">Read more</a>
      </article>

      <article class="resource-card" id="housing-advice">
        <p class="resource-title" data-resource-title="housing">Housing advice</p>
        <p>Get help understanding tenancy questions, housing applications, and local services.</p>
        <a href="#housing-advice-information" data-card-link="housing">Read more</a>
      </article>

      <article class="resource-card" id="digital-skills">
        <h3 data-resource-title="digital">Digital skills support</h3>
        <p>Join friendly sessions covering devices, online forms, and staying safe online.</p>
        <a href="#digital-skills-information" data-card-link="digital">Explore digital skills sessions</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="quick-directory-heading">
    <h2 id="quick-directory-heading">Quick service directory</h2>
    <ul class="service-links">
      <li><a href="#food-support-information" data-service-link="food">Service details</a></li>
      <li><a href="#housing-advice-information" data-service-link="housing">Service details</a></li>
      <li><a href="#digital-skills-information">Digital skills service details</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="choosing-support" aria-labelledby="choosing-support-heading">
    <h2 id="choosing-support-heading">Choosing the right support</h2>
    <p>Check who provides each service, whether you need an appointment, and what information to bring.</p>
    <p><a href="#contact-team">Contact the community support team</a> if you are still unsure which service fits your situation.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="detail-notes" aria-label="Service information">
    <p id="food-support-information"><strong>Food support information:</strong> Drop-in meals are available on weekdays.</p>
    <p id="housing-advice-information"><strong>Housing advice information:</strong> Appointments are available by phone and at the community centre.</p>
    <p id="digital-skills-information"><strong>Digital skills information:</strong> Weekly sessions are free and devices are provided.</p>
    <p id="contact-team"><strong>Community support team:</strong> Call the information desk during weekday opening hours.</p>
  </section>
